mapping "X595.1" source="X595" target="272379006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X595 SNOMED CT 272379006 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides X59
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45756412) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4156363 = (sctid 272379006), the verified Athena crosswalk target for
